{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Why Jump</i> \u2014 a challenging vertical platformer where you'll climb, fall, and question your life choices. <br>Every jump demands focus. Every slip might set you back. But don't worry \u2014 there are checkpoints along the way to help you breathe... at least for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about persistence, patience, and perfectly-timed jumps. <br>So \u2014 will you keep going, or keep asking... Why Jump?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough vertical platforming with smartly placed checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall, learn, and try again \u2014 no permanent punishment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright visuals with dangerously deceptive level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, responsive controls for precise jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for players who love a challenge, but hate giving up</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659120?t=1745914160","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659120?t=1745914160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659120/b08a03f388b6fd1f58197a69feadea5856138368/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745914160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659120/b08a03f388b6fd1f58197a69feadea5856138368/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745914160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Why Jump</i> \u2014 a challenging vertical platformer where you'll climb, fall, and question your life choices. <br>Every jump demands focus. Every slip might set you back. But don't worry \u2014 there are c